sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Operator
  participant S as Intelligence service
  participant G as SONiC Smart Patch
  O->>S: Create plan for one device, package and scope
  S-->>O: Draft target and explicit eligibility
  opt Target recheck needed
    O->>S: Validate exact target
    S->>S: Central recheck clears earlier approval
  end
  O->>S: Approve current review
  O->>S: Request staging
  S->>S: Persist stage request and current identity
  G->>S: Outbound poll
  S-->>G: Stage only if authorization remains current
  G->>G: Simulate dependencies and stage exact artifacts
  Note over G: No installation or full health baseline at stage
  G->>S: Durable staging receipt
  S->>S: Matching successful receipt enables execution
  O->>S: Confirm device ID and request execution
  S->>S: Queue execute request, clear eligibility
  Note over S,G: Core and service container plans remain reviewed maintenance
